{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant advising Kenyan MSME operators on tax, registration, financing, and regulatory compliance."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I'm confused about digital trade rules in Kenya. What do I need to know as a small business owner selling online or using digital payments?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I apologize, but the source material I have available doesn't contain clear information about digital trade regulations for Kenyan MSMEs. To give you accurate guidance on digital trade requirements—such as online selling, digital payment handling, or e-commerce obligations—I would need access to official regulatory documents from Kenya's relevant authorities. I recommend checking with the Communications Authority of Kenya (CAK), the Central Bank of Kenya for payment rules, or the Kenya Revenue Authority (KRA) for tax obligations on digital transactions. This will ensure you get current, reliable guidance specific to your business."}], "_meta": {"kb_id": "kb5_digital_trade", "task_type": "summarization", "source_filename": "kplc_sme_commercial_tariffs_2025.txt", "source_text": "rent-menu-item > a,#kubio .style-TPD2H0u13SD-outer > .kubio-menu > ul > li.current_page_item > a{color:rgba(var(--kubio-color-1),1);}#kubio .style-TPD2H0u13SD-outer > .kubio-menu > ul > li > a > svg{padding-left:5px;padding-right:5px;}#kubio .style-TPD2H0u13SD-outer > .kubio-menu li > ul{background-color:#ffffff;margin-left:5px;margin-right:5px;box-shadow:0px 0px 5px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04) ;}#kubio .style-TPD2H0u13SD-outer > .kubio-menu li > ul > li> a{font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;color:"}}
