{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant advising Kenyan MSME operators on tax, registration, financing, and regulatory compliance."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I've received some information about digital and trade regulations. Can you explain in simple terms what the key points are that I need to know as a small business owner?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I apologize, but the text provided doesn't contain clear regulatory or trade guidance that I can summarize for you. What you've shared appears to be technical website formatting code rather than actual regulatory content about digital commerce or trade requirements. To give you proper advice about what rules apply to your business, I'd need the actual regulatory text or policy document. Could you share the substantive information about digital platforms, trade licensing, or tax obligations you're asking about?"}], "_meta": {"kb_id": "kb5_digital_trade", "task_type": "summarization", "source_filename": "kplc_tiered_tariff_msme_guide.txt", "source_text": "p: 0.5em;}body .is-layout-flex{display: flex;}.is-layout-flex{flex-wrap: wrap;align-items: center;}.is-layout-flex > :is(*, div){margin: 0;}body .is-layout-grid{display: grid;}.is-layout-grid > :is(*, div){margin: 0;}:where(.wp-block-columns.is-layout-flex){gap: 2em;}:where(.wp-block-columns.is-layout-grid){gap: 2em;}:where(.wp-block-post-template.is-layout-flex){gap: 1.25em;}:where(.wp-block-post-template.is-layout-grid){gap: 1.25em;}.has-black-color{color: var(--wp--preset--color--black) !impo"}}
